      "message": "[warning] Line 1037: 🟡 `directory.mkdirs()` is not checked before writing the file. If cache directory creation fails, the subsequent `writeText` failure is reported generically, but a pre-existing non-directory path or partial creation can also leave cleanup/share behavior inconsistent. Check `mkdirs()`/`isDirectory` and fail explicitly before constructing the export file.",
      "revId": "ccce705ca99380e4c1005223ba2676851af39952",
